## 5. End-to-End Request Flow & Interaction

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Browser
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI (main.py)
    participant Auth as Identity (verify.py)
    participant Res as Resolver (resolver.py)
    participant Plan as Planner (plan.py)
    participant Store as HybridStore / DB
    participant Tools as Read Tools (call.py)
    participant Align as Alignment (align.py)
    participant Synth as Synthesis (synthesis.py)

    User->>FE: Submits question ("What was the amount of that?")
    FE->>API: POST /ask (Bearer JWT + Question + SessionID)
    API->>Auth: verify(token) [RS256 Algorithm Pinned]
    Auth-->>API: Claims (subject="dana.reyes", roles=["employee"])
    API->>Res: resolve_followup(question, history[-2:], ctx)
    Note over Res: Rewrites to standalone question using previous turn target.<br/>Discards previous evidence chunks!
    Res-->>API: Active Question: "What was the amount for SUP-001 invoices in EMEA?"
    API->>Plan: build_plan(active_question, visible_tools(claims))
    Note over Plan: Drops tools caller lacks roles for (e.g. get_open_invoices requires 'finance')
    Plan-->>API: Plan(calls=[get_open_invoices], needs_corpus=False)
    API->>Tools: call_read_tool("get_open_invoices", args, ctx)
    Note over Tools: Role Check: 'finance' NOT in caller roles!<br/>Raises Denied("DENIED_IDENTITY")
    Tools-->>API: Denied: Missing role 'finance'
    API->>Synth: Synthesise Answer (Scope Denial detected)
    Note over Synth: Rule 3 & 4: Construct Answer.declined()<br/>Missing sources: ["Finance role entitlement"]
    Synth-->>API: Typed Answer(kind="declined", rewritten_question=..., findings=[])
    API->>Store: Record Turn with caller_identity="dana.reyes" & Audit Log
    API-->>FE: Return JSON Answer Object
    FE-->>User: Renders Red Declination Card + Rewritten Question Banner
```

